{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118075","id":3477529517,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7PRuOt","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118075","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118075.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118075.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118075","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118075/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118075/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118075/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fa9eb45c5e9d16f2098c26d51b2f807099587047","number":118075,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix close dropdown popups correctly on focus loss (X11)","user":{"login":"MWRAlves","id":101740177,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhBukQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101740177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MWRAlves","html_url":"https://github.com/MWRAlves","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MWRAlves/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MWRAlves/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MWRAlves/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MWRAlves/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MWRAlves/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MWRAlves/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MWRAlves/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MWRAlves/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MWRAlves/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #104267\r\nFixes an X11 issue where dropdown menus and similar popups could remain open after switching to another window or workspace.\r\n\r\nOn X11, some no_focus popup windows could remain internally marked as focused even after the application had actually lost focus. This stale focus state prevented the normal application focus loss path from fully updating popup state, which could leave dropdowns visible after Alt-Tab or workspace switching.\r\n\r\nThis change keeps the fix X11-specific, the only place I verified the bug occurred in my system as opposed to Wayland, by:\r\n\r\nusing _window_focus_check() to determine whether the application still has focus\r\nclearing stale focused state for is_popup && no_focus windows only when the application has actually lost focus\r\n\r\nManual Testing:\r\n(On X11 display server)\r\nOpen an editor dropdown menu, Alt-Tab away: popup no longer persists\r\nOpen an editor dropdown menu, switch workspace: popup no longer persists\r\nVerify normal popup dismissal still works inside the editor\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin